      `the report states it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 236 the directors' report meets the requirement` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 236(2) to (5) the directors' report must state that the provision is in force or was in force`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
