    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless it has at all times been kept at the company's registered office"
    ELSE JUST TRUE -- "The company must give notice to the registrar— (a) of the place at which the copy or memorandum is kept available for inspection, and (b) of any change in that place"

